{"id":"n87068-1-7","stage":4,"title":"환절기 · 换季期","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87068-1-7-1","ko":"나 감기 걸렸나 봐. 계속 기침이 나네.","zh":"我好像感冒了。一直都在咳嗽。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}},{"text":"감기","meaning":"感冒","explanation":"감기：感冒","readings":[{"term":"감기","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28635","senseId":"1","lemma":"감기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감기","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3"}},{"text":"걸렸나","meaning":"患","explanation":"걸리다：患；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"걸리다","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86940","senseId":"8","lemma":"걸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸렸나","audio":"/audio/b360a60b11529efb5261.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}},{"text":"기침이","meaning":"咳嗽","explanation":"기침：咳嗽；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기침","audio":"/audio/aa2351b107c957346a08.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38465","senseId":"1","lemma":"기침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기침이","audio":"/audio/c88ea8b3c12d44ff0138.mp3"}},{"text":"나네.","meaning":"发生","explanation":"나다：发生；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나네","audio":"/audio/9cbca1019edbebacfbb8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"2c4cdf56b777f367","term":"감기","zh":"感冒","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3","entryId":"28635","definition":"一般伴有咳嗽、流鼻涕、头痛、发冷等症状的传染病。","pronunciation":["감ː기"]},{"id":"d94590a358564fb8","term":"걸리다","zh":"患","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3","entryId":"86940","definition":"得病。","pronunciation":["걸리다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"23a9f0224cc40ec0","term":"계속","zh":"继续，持续","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3","entryId":"17692","definition":"连续不间断。","pronunciation":["계ː속","게ː속"]},{"id":"aa2351b107c95734","term":"기침","zh":"咳嗽","audio":"/audio/aa2351b107c957346a08.mp3","entryId":"38465","definition":"空气从肺部通过喉咙突然喷出来，同时发出粗声。","pronunciation":["기침"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发生","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现某种现象或事件。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ee5b89efef27238d5a20.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87068-1-7-2","ko":"요즘 환절기라서 감기 환자가 많다더니. 푹 쉬어.","zh":"最近是换季，据说感冒的人很多。好好休息吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"s